    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sliding window</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/longest-substring-without-repeating-characters/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 3</a></div>\n  <h1>Longest Substring Without Repeating Characters</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: grow a window to the right; when a character repeats inside the window, jump the left edge just past its previous copy, and never move it back. One pass, O(n) time, O(alphabet) space.</p>\n"
  },
